{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44045","headline":"赠歌姬 · 崔仲容","name":"赠歌姬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水翦双眸雾翦衣，当筵一曲媚春辉。\n潇湘夜瑟怨犹在，巫峡晓云愁不稀。\n皓齿乍分寒玉细，黛眉轻蹙远山微。\n渭城朝雨休重唱，满眼阳关客未归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔仲容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}